275
00:16:46,400 --> 00:16:48,960
Once we capture an Ink Crystal Beast to use as a Sword Spirit,

276
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:51,240
you’ll get to train there too.

277
00:16:57,960 --> 00:16:59,120
Third Senior Brother,

278
00:16:59,320 --> 00:17:01,150
can we really catch one here ?

279
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:04,200
Chang Hao\NXuan Dao Sect disciple\N6th layer of Qi Condensation

280
00:17:02,680 --> 00:17:05,720
This place became rich in spiritual energy 2 years ago

281
00:17:05,800 --> 00:17:07,400
so it attracted many Spirit Beasts.

282
00:17:07,470 --> 00:17:10,720
Xu Fei\NXuan Dao Sect disciple\N6th layer of Qi Condensation

283
00:17:09,320 --> 00:17:11,640
Maybe there are some treasures here ?

284
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:18,920
This is...

285
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:21,920
Such a powerful aura !

286
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:28,600
Junior Chang Hao of the Xuan Dao Sect,

287
00:17:28,600 --> 00:17:30,200
didn't know Senior was cultivating here.

288
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:31,520
Please forgive me

289
00:17:31,600 --> 00:17:32,760
for my rudeness.

290
00:17:33,400 --> 00:17:34,550
Leave at once !

291
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:36,470
Let’s go !

292
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:29,160
Wang Lin\N15th layer of Qi Condensation

293
00:18:39,270 --> 00:20:41,170
The Divine Sense is a part of counsciousness split off from the cultivator's soul. It can be used to scan things or people (this is how cultivators check each other's cultivation level), to control artifacts (magic objects) or just to attack someone else directly. The Divine Sense can be spread out over an area with low precision or it can be focused on a specific point for more accuracy.\N\NSect Leader Huanglong burned his lifespan to become stronger in the fight. What does it mean ? Aren't Immortals immortal ?\NNo, they aren't immortal. The lifespan of a cultivator is a ressource that is finite and can be used in desperate situations (most cultivators keep their lifespan to live through it though). Lifespan is increased upon a breakthrough or consuming certain medecines (pills). You can think of cultivation as a game of cat and mouse between the cultivators (that cultivate and increase their lifespan) and the law of the heavens (that is coming after them if they run out of lifespan).\N\NPills are quite self-explanatory, they are medecines made from ingredients rich in spiritual energy and can have many different types of properties and usages. Pill-making is a form of external alchemy which is opposed to internal alchemy (cultivation).\N\NThe yellow paper Sun Dazhu was using to make a formation is called a talisman. Talismans have effects in function of what symbol is drawn on them, for example a speed talisman can be put on your legs in order to run faster. Talismans are pretty weak and overall only used by low level cultivators.

294
00:18:44,810 --> 00:18:50,450
I've been walking this path for endless years

295
00:18:47,460 --> 00:18:50,450
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

296
00:18:51,090 --> 00:18:56,050
Is it the compass of fate

297
00:18:52,930 --> 00:18:56,050
that wrote this outcome for us ?

298
00:18:56,210 --> 00:19:01,970
The heavens want to erase your existence,

299
00:19:02,090 --> 00:19:07,690
that's the obsession guiding me.

300
00:19:07,970 --> 00:19:13,290
Is this the path to uncover

301
00:19:09,850 --> 00:19:13,290
truths from falsehoods ?

302
00:19:13,570 --> 00:19:18,890
In a world of murk and shadow,

303
00:19:15,470 --> 00:19:18,890
only the flame of truth can light the way.

304
00:19:18,930 --> 00:19:24,610
Look at them all,

305
00:19:21,810 --> 00:19:24,610
being carried by the waves.

306
00:19:25,050 --> 00:19:29,250
Look at them all,

307
00:19:27,210 --> 00:19:29,250
being drowned.

308
00:19:29,330 --> 00:19:32,570
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

309
00:19:32,610 --> 00:19:35,650
I will let the world refine my soul.

310
00:19:35,780 --> 00:19:41,210
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

311
00:19:37,470 --> 00:19:41,210
I will fight.

312
00:19:41,210 --> 00:19:44,330
I'll break through the abyss of despair

313
00:19:44,330 --> 00:19:47,370
to finally learn who I really am.

314
00:19:47,370 --> 00:19:52,730
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

315
00:19:49,250 --> 00:19:52,730
I embrace this obsession.

316
00:19:52,730 --> 00:19:55,690
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

317
00:19:55,690 --> 00:19:58,490
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

318
00:19:58,490 --> 00:20:03,970
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

319
00:20:00,530 --> 00:20:03,970
I'll still fight.

320
00:20:04,170 --> 00:20:07,330
It's hard to avoid loneliness

321
00:20:07,330 --> 00:20:10,370
when you are above everyone else.

322
00:20:10,370 --> 00:20:16,050
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

323
00:20:12,690 --> 00:20:16,050
be afraid of a firefly ?
